Route3_Text_Youngster::
	.string "Whew… I better take a rest…\n"
	.string "Groan…\p"
	.string "That tunnel from CERULEAN takes a\n"
	.string "lot out of you!$"

Route3_Text_FirebreatherBurtIntro::
	.string "Step right up and take a look!$"

Route3_Text_FirebreatherBurtDefeat::
	.string "Yow! That’s hot!$"

Route3_Text_FirebreatherBurt::
	.string "The greatest firebreather in KANTO,\n"
	.string "that’s me.\p"
	.string "But not the best trainer...$"

Route3_Text_FirebreatherOtisIntro::
	.string "Ah! The weather’s as fine as ever.$"

Route3_Text_FirebreatherOtisDefeat::
	.string "It’s sunny, but I’m all wet...$"

Route3_Text_FirebreatherOtis::
	.string "When it rains, it’s hard to get\n"
	.string "ignition...$"

Route3_Text_YoungsterWarrenIntro::
	.string "Hmmm... I don’t know what to do...$"

Route3_Text_YoungsterWarrenDefeat::
	.string "I knew I’d lose...$"

Route3_Text_YoungsterWarren::
	.string "You looked strong.\n"
	.string "I was afraid to take you on...$"

Route3_Text_YoungsterJimmyIntro::
	.string "I can run like the wind!$"

Route3_Text_YoungsterJimmyDefeat::
	.string "Blown away!$"

Route3_Text_YoungsterJimmy::
	.string "I wear shorts the whole year round.\n"
	.string "That’s my fashion policy.$"

Route3_Text_Sign::
	.string "MT. MOON SQUARE\n"
	.string "Just go up the stairs.$"
